  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside a refinement path supplementary formation that amplifies his refinement path killer moves, Fang Yuan activates Refinement Formation Rain. Rain drizzles above the sea, countless drops enter the underwater formation, and Gu worms are refined one by one. In a short time he has already refined the outer layer.",
      "chapters": [
        1904
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The move uses rank eight Water Refinement Immortal Gu as its core; Fang Yuan uses many Gu worms to suppress the rank eight aura and disguise it as rank seven. After rebirth he annexed Lang Ya Sect, gained that Immortal Gu, and created this move. After returning to Southern Border, he used it to refine Chi Qu You’s formation and captured many Gu Immortals inside. After he refined thirty percent of the underwater formation, the move’s effect fell drastically and progress slowed; he judges that it is only a killer move, and that the real effect depends on his understanding of the target formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1904
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_water_refinement_gu",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_chi_qu_you",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the supplementary formations are adjusted, Fang Yuan activates refinement formation rain again and refines territory Gu. When only the core forty percent of the underwater formation remains, using refinement formation rain has little to no effect.",
      "chapters": [
        1905
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "territory-gu-refined-effect-fades",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_territory_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, Fang Yuan activates Refinement Formation Rain; rain falls from the sky and gradually infiltrates the formation, and the periphery is already refined. With his formation path and wisdom path attainment, and with prior dream realm dealings that gave him information about Chi Qu You’s formation, the move completely counters that formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1922
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "countering-chi-qu-yous-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    }
  ],
